s in docs/plans/llm-gateway-options.md. Constraints: no cluster config changes, do not touch the Flash serving args, nothing runs beside this as a second probe. All model calls stay on the homelab. This repo is public: no internal addresses or private text in the fixtures, scripts or docs. One PR for the probe, one for the results. DONE WHEN: the gate result and the total-time numbers for arm V are merged, or the plan says plainly why the run could not be completed.

